well kurt zuma appeared here with his  brother joanne both involved in this  attack on the cat they appeared here at  thames magistrates court  arriving for the sentencing and it was  last week where they appeared and both  pled guilty kurt pleaded guilty to two  counts of causing unnecessary suffering  to a protected animal and joanne pleaded  guilty to one count of aiding and  abetting  his brother now their sentencing today  lasted around 20 minutes they sat in the  dock together and kurt zuma was handed a  12-month community order that's going to  involve 180 hours of unpaid work his  brother joanne was handed a 12-month  community order also with 140 hours of  unpaid work and like you said they've  been banned from keeping cats for a  period of five years and on top of all  of that as well kurt zuma will have to  pay charges of nearly 9 000 pounds now  this all of course pertains to that  snapchat video that was uploaded which  showed kurt volley volleying the cat  across the kitchen he threw shoes at it  and then proceeded to slap its head  whilst his younger son was holding the  cat  and last week in court it was  established that in the video kurt zuma  was heard saying i swear i'll kill it i  swear i'll kill it now today the court  heard that  the there were 80 followers on the  snapchat account five of these people  viewed the video and it was taken down  within around five minutes but last week  they also established that it did seem  to be premeditated as well the judge  described this behavior as being  disgraceful and reprehensible she said  that the cat was looking to kurt zuma  and his brother joanne to fulfill  its needs but it suffered from fear and  anxiety as a result we know that the cat  has been is being re-homed by the rspca  and as a consequence of this we also  know that kurt zuma has lost a  sponsorship deal he's been fined 250 000  pounds by his club west ham  and uh in the last few moments west ham  have also released a statement in which  they say that they condem in the  strongest terms any form of animal abuse  or cruelty they speak about the fine  that kurt was  issued with and they say that every  single penny of this will go  to deserving charities dedicated to  animal welfare so kurt zuma  and his brother joanne  banned from keeping cats for five years  and given 12-month community orders
 

